This is Hidden Brain, I'm Shankar Vetantam. Hi, how are you? Thank you! Sarah and David Risa recently bought a place outside of Washington DC. They sound excited because this is the first time they're hosting both their families. We are making today a vegetable frittata with tomato, basil and goat cheese. We've got home fries. Sarah and David wanted to start a new tradition. Cook brunch with ingredients from their home garden.
这里是《隐藏的大脑》，我是尚卡尔·韦丹塔。嗨，你好吗？谢谢！萨拉和大卫·里萨最近在华盛顿特区郊外买了一处房产。听起来他们很兴奋，因为这是他们第一次同时接待双方的家人。我们今天要做的是一道番茄、罗勒和山羊奶酪蔬菜烘蛋。我们还准备了家常炸薯条。萨拉和大卫想开启一项新的传统。用他们自家花园里种的食材来做早午餐。

