And they said, that's ridiculous. I I said, well, yeah, I mean, they eat it. And they said, that's ridiculous. I said, would you mind if I give the dogs a little piece of cracker with some hot sauce on it and without and see what they choose? So they said, go ahead. And so I did, but go around the village with pigs and dogs. I put up one cracker in front of them with hot pepper sauce and another without, and I'd see what they did.
他们说：“这太荒谬了。”我说：“好吧，我是说，它们确实吃啊。”他们说：“这太荒谬了。”我说：“你们介意我给狗一块抹了辣酱的饼干，看看它们会怎么选吗？”他们说：“去吧。”于是我就照做了，带着猪和狗在村子里转悠。我在它们面前放了一块抹了辣椒酱的饼干，另一块没有，然后看它们的反应。

9
