Tell me that story. Well, my wife at the time was a cookbook writer, and she was very interested in cuisine. We went to a Korean restaurant in New York, and the people around us, they were ordering some dish that we didn't recognize. So we said to the waiter, we would like that. And he says, you don't want that. I said, no, no, we said, we really like to try new foods.
